      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Three Essential Engineering Rules:\n1. val(c) = c - 'a' + 1 (starts at 1, so 'a' != 'aa' != 'aaa')\n2. Base P = 31 (prime > 26, prevents collisions like 'ka' vs 'ab')\n3. Modulo M = 10^9 + 7 (large prime keeps numbers within long long)",
